«
@@ ============================================================
@@ WingPanels — area, aspect ratio and mean aerodynamic chord of a
@@ wing made of several straight tapered panels.
@@
@@ Input:  a list of stations of the half wing, from the root to the
@@         tip, one { y c xLE } list each: the spanwise position y,
@@         the chord c, and the position xLE of the leading edge,
@@         positive aft (0 if omitted). Between two stations, the
@@         chord and the leading edge vary linearly.
@@         Lengths may carry units; the results are then in the unit
@@         of the span of the last station.
@@ Output: Sw, the area of the whole wing; AR, the aspect ratio;
@@         MAC, the mean aerodynamic chord; yMAC, the spanwise
@@         position of its centroid; xMAC, the position of its leading
@@         edge; tagged.
@@ Method: exact integrals of c, c², c·y and c·xLE over each panel:
@@ Sw = 2∫c dy, MAC = ∫c² dy/∫c dy, yMAC = ∫c·y dy/∫c dy,
@@ xMAC = ∫c·xLE dy/∫c dy; the span is twice the y of the last
@@ station. A first station away from the center line leaves out
@@ the part of the wing inside the fuselage.
@@ Author & design          : Jean Wilson
@@ Co-authors & programming  : Claude & Claude Code (Anthropic)
@@ ============================================================
  → stl
  «
    IF stl TypeName "list" ≠ THEN
      "WingPanels needs a list of stations { y c xLE }" DoError
    END
    stl SIZE
    → nst
    «
      IF nst 2 < THEN "WingPanels needs two stations or more" DoError END
      stl nst GET 1 GET
      IF DUP TypeName "unit" == THEN DUP UVAL / ELSE DROP 1 END
      → uu
      «
        1 nst FOR ii
          stl ii GET 1 GET IF DUP TypeName "unit" == THEN uu CONVERT UVAL END
        NEXT nst →LIST
        1 nst FOR ii
          stl ii GET 2 GET IF DUP TypeName "unit" == THEN uu CONVERT UVAL END
        NEXT nst →LIST
        1 nst FOR ii
          stl ii GET
          IF DUP SIZE 3 ≥ THEN
            3 GET IF DUP TypeName "unit" == THEN uu CONVERT UVAL END
          ELSE DROP 0 END
        NEXT nst →LIST
        0 0 0 0
        → ys cs xs sa s2 sy sx
        «
          1 nst 1 - FOR ii
            ys ii GET ys ii 1 + GET cs ii GET cs ii 1 + GET
            xs ii GET xs ii 1 + GET
            → ya yb ca cb xa xb
            «
              IF yb ya ≤ THEN "WingPanels: y must increase from the root to the tip" DoError END
              yb ya -
              → ll
              «
                sa ll ca cb + * 2 / + 'sa' STO
                s2 ll ca SQ ca cb * + cb SQ + * 3 / + 's2' STO
                sy ll 6 / 2 ca * ya * ca yb * + cb ya * + 2 cb * yb * + * + 'sy' STO
                sx ll 6 / 2 ca * xa * ca xb * + cb xa * + 2 cb * xb * + * + 'sx' STO
              »
            »
          NEXT
          ys nst GET
          → bh
          «
            2 sa * uu SQ * "Sw" →TAG
            2 bh * SQ 2 sa * / "AR" →TAG
            s2 sa / uu * "MAC" →TAG
            sy sa / uu * "yMAC" →TAG
            sx sa / uu * "xMAC" →TAG
          »
        »
      »
    »
  »
»
